    {
      "name": "xpos1",
      "group": "Custom Grid",
      "type": "list",
      "default": [
        3,
        [
          2,
          [
            3,
            3
          ]
        ],
        0,
        0,
        2,
        4,
        0
      ],
      "description": "Custom gid sizes I am not sure it this is really useful, but its possible, so here we are. 0:off the cell is off 1:on the cell is on and all corners are rounded 2-16, are bitwise values used to calculate what corners should be rounded, you need to subtract 2 from the value for the bitwise logic (so it does not clash with 0 and 1). [c,[x,y]], c corner value as shown above. [x,y] x and y size of the cell.",
